er level (up to +15% max HP, +30% max mana, +20% mana regeneration)</li> <li><a href=\"/en/w/overrank/passives/momentum\">Momentum</a>: +3% attack speed per level (up to +9% attack speed)</li> <li><a href=\"/en/w/overrank/passives/veteran\">Veteran</a>: +4% damage, +2% damage reduction per level (up to +8% damage, +4% damage reduction)</li> </ul>"}]}, {"id": "how-to-unlock", "heading": "How to unlock", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "text": "Pick it freely in the class window (status window, then Change class ).", "html": "<p>Pick it freely in the class window (status window, then <strong>Change class</strong>).</p>"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Changing class: the first change of a profile is free, then it costs 100 shards × your level (at least 1,000). There is a 60 s delay between two changes, your level is kept by steps of 50 (level 449 becomes 400), and your stat points and skill trees are given back. See Economy formulas .", "html": "<p>Changing class: the first change of a profile is free, then it costs <strong>100 shards × your level</strong> (at least 1,000). There is a 60 s delay between two changes, your level is kept by steps of 50 (level 449 becomes 400), and your stat points and skill trees are given back. See <a href=\"/en/w/overrank/formulas/economy\">Economy formulas</a>.</p>"}]}], "media": [{"src": "/api/media/wiki/2026/10/model-classes-attacker.glb", "alt": "Attacker: interactive 3D view", "kind": "3d-model"}], "related": [{"text": "Reaper", "href": "/en/w/overrank/classes/reaper", "img": "/games/overrank/classes/reaper.webp"}, {"text": "Overlord", "href": "/en/w/overrank/classes/overlord", "img": "/games/overrank/classes/overlord.webp"}, {"text": "Warper", "href": "/en/w/overrank/classes/warper", "img": "/games/overrank/classes/warper.webp"}, {"text": "Assassin", "href": "/en/w/overrank/classes/assassin", "img": "/games/overrank/classes/assassin.webp"}], "toc": [{"id": "overview", "text": "Overview"}, {"id": "playstyle", "text": "Playstyle"}, {"id": "bonus